<title>POLAND: ELEKTROBUDOWA SIGNS DM 1.2 MLN DEAL.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROBUDOWA SIGNS DM 1.2 MLN DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction company Elektrobudowa SA signed a 1.2 million marks worth contract with a Polish unit of Bosch-Siemens, Elektrobudowa said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the the contract for making electrical installation in new washing machines factory, would be carried out from September 26, 1996 to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
